WEBVTT

00:11:59.710 --> 00:12:02.329
in sem tolikokrat

00:12:02.329 --> 00:12:06.110
z napihnjenim egom

00:12:06.110 --> 00:12:10.577
vadila, kaj bom povedala na obali.

00:12:10.577 --> 00:12:12.191
Ko je Bonnie mislila, da

00:12:12.191 --> 00:12:14.199
mi zateka grlo,

00:12:14.199 --> 00:12:16.161
in je k našemu čolnu
pripeljala zdravstveno ekipo,

00:12:16.161 --> 00:12:19.204
da jim je povedala,

00:12:19.204 --> 00:12:20.621
da s težavo diham.

00:12:20.621 --> 00:12:23.715
Še 12, 24 ur v slani vodi,

00:12:23.715 --> 00:12:25.410
vsa ta stvar - in pomislila sem

00:12:25.425 --> 00:12:30.157
v trenutku halucinacije,
da sem slišala besedo traheotomija.